 21	/// Parse input into blocks. TOTAL — never errors (Law 3B).
 22	///
 23	/// Grammar:
 24	/// - A block is a maximal run of non-blank lines.
 25	/// - Blank lines (empty or whitespace-only) separate blocks.
 26	/// - Leading/trailing blank lines produce no blocks.
 27	/// - ID marker: last line ends with `{#id}` where id matches `[A-Za-z0-9_-]+`,
