 8845	/// reads the working directory reports a different durable surface on a dirty
 8846	/// tree than a fresh clone does, and the clone is the one that has to reproduce
 8847	/// this.
 8848	///
 8849	/// `liminal-xtask` is excluded — the verifier is not runtime code, and its
 8850	/// operator table contains the marker as a string literal, so including it
 8851	/// would make this count self-referential. `tests/` is excluded: an integration
 8852	/// test's commit is not a transition the product performs.
